        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 1377204544,
        "heading": "Uses",
        "text": "Lumber and pulpwood from this tree shipped to Florida is the main export of the Abaco Islands.\nThe Uverito forest in Venezuela, located between the states of Anzoátegui and Monagas, is the largest artificial forest in the world planted by man, with around 600,000 hectares (1,500,000 acres) of Caribbean pine forest plantations.",
        "truncated": false
      }
    }
